  GroupArchive
  /// `group_join`
  GroupJoin
  /// `group_leave`
  GroupLeave
  /// `group_name`
  GroupName
  /// `group_purpose`
  GroupPurpose
  /// `group_topic`
  GroupTopic
  /// `group_unarchive`
  GroupUnarchive
  /// `huddle_thread`
  HuddleThread
