  MessageChanged
  /// `message_deleted`
  MessageDeleted
  /// `message_replied`
  MessageReplied
  /// `pinned_item`
  PinnedItem
  /// `reminder_add`
  ReminderAdd
  /// `reply_broadcast`
  ReplyBroadcast
  /// `thread_broadcast`
  ThreadBroadcast
